{\b\fs22 DarkCipher MaskedMail}\par
Open-source software under the MIT License. Copyright \'a9 2026 darkcipher0x.\par
\par
Creates and manages masked email addresses (Fastmail, SimpleLogin, addy.io, Firefox Relay), files their mail into folders in your Fastmail account and sends mail from them. Your API keys and settings are encrypted on this PC with AES-256-GCM. No account, no cloud service of its own, no telemetry: it only talks to the services whose keys you enter.\par
